4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bJztZenh8xIQ7kNvwEjLKMo&_nc_oc=AdqMNkVW7XdEs-Z5DYPHqZ8Orgo9FM4DHoHuE-Nuv6jOZ1nXHS4jXMnuUgotRr1UZb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyf75EX0KW9bRGxnA85ejgnCeObvirLm61maUSeZO3dFw&oe=69D10C54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uKvfG7W1xg0Q7kNvwFumAlh&_nc_oc=Adrv7ZGF4ijP4Cxbw1tNv4WrlVdWik4VGyvjia40u-tbkWc7DvXNsvKxToB1bveQzdw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx7SJA4eNKMc3IqztzeQF3XsQLc3rS0bTlrZjcy2-4wcQ&oe=69D11132"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PvftRdKSzBwQ7kNvwF9n4YD&_nc_oc=AdqaG-1VbNZcHOoODBMnjjgazyBmhAhsH2vmrdx_ErxXpw7T43CRNgBQhL5pQQUbGJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwm5VEPhU2Pk8wQbmt7LIyIbEi5CqZOEg1XSY4Wcw41Pw&oe=69D11ED5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p